{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzled Hive is a puzzle-adventure narrative game centered around a multi-layered hexagonal maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Meo and Noth in their adventure to solve puzzles in the simple, hexagonal beehive world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Maze and Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tA complex structure with multiple layers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/6bad386ce5a648f9c863c111b8c555ce.poster.avif?t=1755689668\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/6bad386ce5a648f9c863c111b8c555ce.webm?t=1755689668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/6bad386ce5a648f9c863c111b8c555ce.mp4?t=1755689668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tUse monitors to observe your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/03036dba3fe4546f5c39e9ec80bcf430.poster.avif?t=1755689668\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/03036dba3fe4546f5c39e9ec80bcf430.webm?t=1755689668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/03036dba3fe4546f5c39e9ec80bcf430.mp4?t=1755689668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tRich, colorful puzzles in dim environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/9d993fba05a4cbfb77eb8e2d7e043b1c.poster.avif?t=1755689668\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/9d993fba05a4cbfb77eb8e2d7e043b1c.webm?t=1755689668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/9d993fba05a4cbfb77eb8e2d7e043b1c.mp4?t=1755689668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tMachines that can directly change the maze!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/5d9686818a475356ae52d822bca22459.poster.avif?t=1755689668\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/5d9686818a475356ae52d822bca22459.webm?t=1755689668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/5d9686818a475356ae52d822bca22459.mp4?t=1755689668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story in the Hive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meo: Although I don't know how I get here, the environment looks nice, and the little bees seem really friendly. I want to learn more about this hive, then find a way back home and recover my memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noth: Wow, I was really startled when I saw Meo fall, but I'm glad he's okay. I've never seen a creature like him! It feels special, and I'll make sure to help him! The hive is a great place!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >???: Where are they?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >???: Sir, they're heading towards...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >???: Have you made your decision?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meo: What is your answer, Noth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noth: I...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the puzzle along with dialogue and exploration, then make your choice. You are the final piece of the puzzle, the one sitting in front of the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/509e23ed8af17485b4023e8ab77a5b98.poster.avif?t=1755689668\" width=658 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/509e23ed8af17485b4023e8ab77a5b98.webm?t=1755689668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/509e23ed8af17485b4023e8ab77a5b98.mp4?t=1755689668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Words from the Developers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello! We are Player Links Players (PLP, which means &quot;drifting bottle&quot; in Chinese), a studio currently working on our first indie game. Although there are still many shortcomings at this moment, it's just the beginning. In the official version, we will do our best to create an interesting game! And special thanks to Vira Lee, who created bgm for Puzzled Hive!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contact us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will welcome any idea or suggestion. You can find us via:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bilibili: \u6df1\u540d\u4e94\u4ecb\u662f\u5728\u4e0b\uff08will update my developing progress here\uff09</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ group: 930475923</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A picture of me with Meo and Noth drawn by my friend EZ to celebrate the demo launch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for supporting us, and we are looking forward to your experience in Puzzled Hive! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/c8e3bfd30fbeefa62fec6fc6c542ce1f.avif?t=1755689668\" width=378 height=452 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2891580?t=1755689668","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/5159c9b4789aaee67055812309ecfe59730ba0f6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755689668","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/949b974ebd13ca342dac862615c8ccd93c219a0a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755689668","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/949b974ebd13ca342dac862615c8ccd93c219a0a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755689668","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2979590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzled Hive is a puzzle-adventure narrative game centered around a multi-layered hexagonal maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Meo and Noth in their adventure to solve puzzles in the simple, hexagonal beehive world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Maze and Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tA complex structure with multiple layers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/6bad386ce5a648f9c863c111b8c555ce.poster.avif?t=1755689668\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/6bad386ce5a648f9c863c111b8c555ce.webm?t=1755689668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/6bad386ce5a648f9c863c111b8c555ce.mp4?t=1755689668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tUse monitors to observe your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/03036dba3fe4546f5c39e9ec80bcf430.poster.avif?t=1755689668\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/03036dba3fe4546f5c39e9ec80bcf430.webm?t=1755689668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/03036dba3fe4546f5c39e9ec80bcf430.mp4?t=1755689668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tRich, colorful puzzles in dim environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/9d993fba05a4cbfb77eb8e2d7e043b1c.poster.avif?t=1755689668\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/9d993fba05a4cbfb77eb8e2d7e043b1c.webm?t=1755689668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/9d993fba05a4cbfb77eb8e2d7e043b1c.mp4?t=1755689668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tMachines that can directly change the maze!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/5d9686818a475356ae52d822bca22459.poster.avif?t=1755689668\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steams