5b98.mp4?t=1755689668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Words from the Developers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello! We are Player Links Players (PLP, which means &quot;drifting bottle&quot; in Chinese), a studio currently working on our first indie game. Although there are still many shortcomings at this moment, it's just the beginning. In the official version, we will do our best to create an interesting game! And special thanks to Vira Lee, who created bgm for Puzzled Hive!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contact us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will welcome any idea or suggestion. You can find us via:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bilibili: \u6df1\u540d\u4e94\u4ecb\u662f\u5728\u4e0b\uff08will update my developing progress here\uff09</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ group: 930475923</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A picture of me with Meo and Noth drawn by my friend EZ to celebrate the demo launch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for supporting us, and we are looking forward to your experience in Puzzled Hive! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/extras/c8e3bfd30fbeefa62fec6fc6c542ce1f.avif?t=1755689668\" width=378 height=452 /></span></p>","developers":["Player Links Players\uff08PLP\u6f02\u6d41\u74f6\uff09"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891580/f40c516c60e762b4d3536a907d6cc2eb137dc618/header.jpg?t=1755689668","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highligh